   "texts": [
    "What if you had to pay when a package came again because you were not home?",
    "A redelivery fee is extra money paid by the person getting the package.",
    "It is added to the usual delivery cost.",
    "How should we decide whether to charge this fee or cut repeat deliveries another way?",
    "Let’s hear from three people with different lives and views."
   ]
