   "texts": [
    "When I leave a note saying no one was home, I feel a little sad, too.",
    "But then I go to the next house.",
    "I really want fewer redeliveries.",
    "They are hard on us, too.",
    "Even so, I can’t simply say customers should pay the cost.",
    "I think the cost should be part of the general fee for carrying packages.",
    "That makes more sense than charging each person who was not home for their redelivery.",
    "I want the company to think about whether free delivery for online orders should stay as it is.",
    "If it changes delivery fees, I want it to look at how it sets them, too.",
    "Then the money can really reach the people who deliver packages."
   ]
  },
