   "texts": [
    "Having to pay for a redelivery just doesn’t feel right to me.",
    "My husband and I are both away at work.",
    "So, when we can choose a delivery time, we choose a day and time when we know we’ll be home.",
    "But once, I chose a morning time, and the package did not come.",
    "I went out to do an errand.",
    "When I came back, there was a note saying they had tried to deliver it.",
    "There are also many packages where we cannot choose a time.",
    "We do not know when they will come, either.",
    "Before they charge us, I want them to fix two things: come at the time we chose and tell us when the package will arrive.",
    "Delivery workers must have a hard time because there are not enough of them.",
    "I guess it can’t be helped.",
    "But I can’t accept having to pay for that.",
    "Am I wrong to feel this way?"
   ]
